{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act44side_level_act44side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act44side",
  "stageId": "act44side_05",
  "title": "遗祸",
  "storyCode": "AT-5",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4dfd3f070d0d53c983be2b08e8786db7d44f33b75cc06a33c1a24dba5989419c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三船先生，您真的要亲自去锻冶町吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是我和铁斋、和星熊之间的事，只有我亲自了结，这事才算办得漂亮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "按照您现在的谋划，说实话，就算没有般若，铁斋也会就范。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就这么不愿意让星熊回来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是觉得没必要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也是，她一回来，你的工作量多了不少。看在你要接我班的分上，我可以给你讲得明白一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "澪，你觉得想在御机活得好，什么最重要？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "团结？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，最重要的是......“漂亮”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "外表上的华丽美观可以一举扭转世人心中的成见，你、我，我们都得益于此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果一直是当年那副小混混的打扮，我怕不是第一次上电视就要被人轰下去，更别说把金石台办到今天这步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而做事，同样讲究漂亮，讲究美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "乌萨斯有个我记不起名字的作家说过一句话，如果第一幕出现了一把铳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那么，最迟到第三幕，这把铳一定要被一个拉特兰人握在手中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三船先生，据说哥伦比亚有一群叫黑钢的人也会用铳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，你明白我意思就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "御机太大，发展得也太快，我们很多时候没办法确定自己做的事究竟是否正确......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就只能把事情做得有始有终，让每个人都去他们该去的地方，让每一把铳都在最后扣响，这也是漂亮，这也是美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听起来更像......把事情做绝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你愿意怎么想都随你去。等你成了金石会的四代目会长，你大可以试一试我说的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过现在，你还是专心休息，等着对付星熊吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......星熊是强敌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但她是鬼，而且是已经失控过一次的鬼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听说过一个叫奎隆的人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "据说是个很久很久以前的人，和鬼族以及僧院有关，再多就不知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "铁斋以前除了那些老掉牙的武家故事，就喜欢讲这个人的传说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些传说真假难辨，有的还自相矛盾，比如关于奎隆的死，铁斋至少讲过三种不同的版本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但其中我最喜欢的一种，就很残忍，也很......美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在真正取得涅槃，遁入阇那之前，奎隆听见了最后一支鬼族被迫成为苇原之民时骨肉分离的哭声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但那时的奎隆已经形销骨立，无力从无忧树下离开，无力仗剑拯救同族，甚至无力控制自己青色的怒火——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "于是，怒火占据了奎隆的心神，让他彻底失却了神智，让他以垂死之躯消灭了一整支军队，可他要保护的同族也全数死在他的剑下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至于这个故事里的奎隆是力尽而死，还是死于自戕，抑或是无情到即便如此仍然能心安理得地涅槃，就不得而知了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我不懂您讲这位奎隆的传说有什么用意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当一个鬼意识到自己无能为力的那一刻，总是其最脆弱的时候。至于是一蹶不振，还是陷入疯狂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们要对付的这一位，可是有过先例的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，快去休息吧。我也该见见我们的客人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三船先生......您贵安？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么样，没伤着吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有，没有！倒不如说这是我最近睡得最香的一觉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "对嘛，干你们这一行的，就该像你这样，风趣幽默，笑面迎人......\n还喜欢东挨西问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去给星熊打个电话，就说......我找她有事相商。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个......三船先生，您看，星熊她毕竟帮了我不少......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帮你查明了“轮入道”的真相？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不止如此吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你站在摊前怅然若失的时候，到底在想什么呢？这么多年追逐怪谈的努力都白费了，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在你知道了，一切都是虚妄。你好像被我和我构筑的这些怪谈给骗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您......为什么要这么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这和你无关。你就当自己太倒霉吧。但反正生活是要继续的，所以，如果你愿意，可以把一些更实在的东西抓在手里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您在利诱我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "利诱？打电话，你以后继续做你的情报商。不打，你知道金石会对敌人会怎么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "三船先生——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要是想不起来，我很愿意提醒你一下，记得你的右眼是怎么丢的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......记得。当时是我为了追逐一桩怪谈，冲撞了三船先生和人谈事的场合......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我废你一只眼，是因为你当初看了不该看的东西。而我留你另一只眼，是珍惜你的才能，也是对你的警告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在，你该帮我做事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您能不能给我几分钟，让我想想——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三船缓缓从腰间抽出刀来。\n森内盯着那把刀的刀尖，看着它一寸一寸地接近自己的咽喉。\n他吞了口唾沫，连自己都不确定下一个动作究竟是张口还是闭口——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "打斗声？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "还未等森内反应过来，办公室的门突然被猛烈地撞开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "星、星熊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他困不住我，我还有些事要当面问他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "森内深深看了星熊一眼，转身快步离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "金兵卫，我从你手里抢了人，你似乎一点也不着急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本以为要大费周章的事，突然水到渠成了，这有什么好着急的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你写假信让我回来，究竟是为了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这事有点复杂，我刚跟人说过一遍，没心情再跟你讲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过老头子哪怕再愚钝，也该知道其中最浅显的一条......般若吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "般若？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们连这都想不到？哈哈，不愧是能把亲生儿子都逼得和他反目成仇的“任侠”，不愧是他偏爱的“金石会的青鬼”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "澪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "休息时间好像不太够，不过，还是给我拖住她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拖住我，你的人就能赢铁斋叔？做梦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么非要在刀剑上拼个输赢？这有意义吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你还能怎么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你会知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "失陪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "站住——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "该站住的是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "火光。嗡鸣。\n一排排屏风依然错落地伫立在目及之处，纹丝不动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们已经护送三船先生走了。你现在的对手是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的刀。出鞘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......对付你还用不着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "澪的身后传来刺耳的金属摩擦声，一只黑色的“鬼手”从她的身后钻出，不急不慢地绕在白色的短刀上。\n一个人，三只手，三把刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的确很强，但这不代表着此时此刻你能从我这里脱身，更别说你连刀都不愿意出鞘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁说我的武器只有这把刀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "话音还未落，星熊就高抬起右腿，脚重重地砸向了旁边的圆桌。\n圆桌翻转着飞上了空中，遮住对手的视线。\n一个有力的跃步，星熊连刀带鞘瞄准对手的头——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而迎接她的，是三道刀光，和被刀光平平整整地切开的圆桌。\n刀鞘跟那只黑色的手相碰，一股大力从鞘上传来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喝啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......好强的蛮力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到底为什么不出鞘？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和你无关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你在害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我？害怕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怕刀出鞘，会发生你不愿意发生的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奎隆的死......原来如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奎隆的死？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......但无论你此刻是否出鞘，你害怕的事都会发生。如果三船先生预料得没错，你都会走向那个结局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我听不懂你说的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......卑鄙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不。不是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "澪",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在说我自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "奔跑。逃跑。\n森内不知自己跑了多久，他只感觉自己的五脏六腑都在抖动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "呼......呼......呼......\n咳咳咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我甩掉他们了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你自己出来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的神明",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么快就把我忘了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "神明大人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的神明",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别这么看我。我不是来帮你的。我讨厌在你的摊子那里得到的怪谈的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的神明",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "非常讨厌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的神明",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我本来想着从此和你，和怪谈，都彻底断绝关系，甚至离开御机，去北边转转散散心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的神明",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惜，就在这个时候，有个家伙拜托了我一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁？宫司大人吗？他托您找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的神明",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那还能有谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的神明",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "难道？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的神明",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那家伙只让我给你带一句话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的神明",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“吾辈会在你常去的那个天台见你。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“吾辈”？他——祂？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的神明",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "话带到了。我该走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "神明掉转独轮车头，刚想骑起来，森内已经跑远了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的神明",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的神明",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......找了你这么多年，你就这么回报人家，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "好事的神明",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，我又管得了谁了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哒。哒。哒。\n森内拾级而上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "门开启的一瞬间，一阵风朝森内迎面吹来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "多少个夕阳时分，他就躺在天台之上，看着天空由红变暗，直到星星依稀可见，又被城市亮起的灯光掩盖。\n现在时候尚早，天台上本不该是这般黄昏似的景色，但他无暇顾及这些，或者，他将这也当成了神明将至的某种预兆。\n他盯着天空，甚至不知道自己现在心情如何。\n兴奋？激动？如愿以偿？空虚？落寞？\n但无论如何，他终究还是一个人躺在那里，等着一个也许永远都不会来的客人......\n直到闷热的风让他不知不觉陷入沉眠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "父亲......神龛的后面好像有什么东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "彻，在神社这种严肃的场所，不要随便乱看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可那边真的有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿彻，快过来，轮到我们祈福了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "母亲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "神明大人，希望我们一家人能平平安安，赶快还完欠下的贷......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这样......贷款应该就还完了，而且还能有盈余......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这下我们家可算是脱离困境了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？您......怎么到这里来了？神社气闷？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "神明大人，谢谢您！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最近父亲变开心了很多，母亲也有时间带我出去玩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还能再来找您吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——不，我一定会再来找您的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "神明大人，我家的店开起来了！好漂亮的店，您要来看看吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年幼的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "神明大人，我向您道歉，这段时间我一直在给家里帮忙，没来找您......您不要生气了，别再躲着我了，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年少的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "神明大人，您......在吗？您已经离我而去了？还是说......您不愿意见我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年少的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我、我就当您只是不愿意见我，但还在听我说话了，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最近家里出了一些变故，父亲他可能又得回去卖苦力了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "母亲一直帮人缝补衣服，眼睛越来越差了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我知道，这一定和您没关系，您已经给了我们家这么大的照拂，一定不可能再收回去的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年轻的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不再年轻的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "神明大人，父亲他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不再年轻的森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他死了。接受不了那么大的打击，把自己喝死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......所以，您在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森内",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "神明大人，您到底......在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这间凶宅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里是空的......有蹊跷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这座宅子居然通到移动城市的地下结构？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这、这可怎么找？这可不只是一栋房子或者一个锻冶町那么大了，整个地块说不定都是连通的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别泄气！只要找到那个混蛋——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这、这是？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哲也瞠目结舌，站在了原地。他面前密密麻麻地堆了几十个箱子，显然是有人刻意堆放在这里的。\n他用力眨了眨眼睛，走上前去，缓缓把其中一个箱子打开......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是......武器？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "制式刀，弩......掷弹筒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "上面印着的是......帆足家的家徽？北院的大家族？这里是他们藏军火的地方？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他把装满武器的箱子搬下来，打开原本压在下面的，发现里面是北院制式的军用食品和医疗用具。\n他几乎疯了一般把箱子挨个搬下来一一打开。\n所有他打开的箱子，无一例外，全都装着北院生产的军事用品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是......当年爸拼死否认的北院军火？！怎么会在这里——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隐匿的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小子，你做过头了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隐匿的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老板让你找北院间谍的线索，你找到就够了。这么一箱一箱地开过去，事后整理起来也很麻烦的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你刚刚拍了我的照片？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隐匿的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "毕竟是大功一件，留个影，免得日后再生争端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隐匿的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隐匿的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去见三船先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等、等下。你在跟踪我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隐匿的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那不重要，重要的是，你在为三船先生做事，我也一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隐匿的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有你那面具，一起摘了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隐匿的忍者",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老板一会儿要正式接见你，你还戴着个面具，多少有点不尊重了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不知为何，哲也忽然觉得有一阵寒风从通道深处吹来，吹得他脊背发凉，但他此刻别无选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
